.env*.local

# typescript
*.tsbuildinfo

# generated native folders
/ios
/android

# Firebase credential files (task 10)
# google-services.json is committed intentionally: it ships inside the app binary
# anyway and its Android API key is restricted by package name + signing cert.
# Committing it lets `eas build --local` (which builds from the git archive) find
# it, since local builds don't inject the EAS file env var. The iOS plist and the
# admin service-account.json (a true secret) stay ignored.
# google-services.json  (intentionally tracked — see above)
GoogleService-Info.plist
service-account.json

# local env (EXPO_PUBLIC_* values incl. Sentry DSN)
.env
